<div class="content-inner">




<div class="question">
<h2 class="question-title"></h2>

<div class="answer">

<div class="meta">
<img class="avatar" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9ad86e11a77d14187aee7583000213d0_l.jpg?source=8673f162">
<span class="author">小星有鬼，</span><span class="bio">自然博物写作者，在鸟兽草木间寻找诗意和真相。</span>
<a href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/2067927081439031323/answer/2068348937350783537" class="originUrl" hidden>查看知乎原文</a>
</div>

<div class="content">
<p>小菇科<strong>小菇属 （<em>Mycena</em>）</strong>有一些造型可爱的菌子，譬如<strong>暗蓝小菇 （<em>Mycena lazulina</em>）</strong>：</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c1789bb9b0dce70d65f7622630cc64c2_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>暗蓝小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-ec0a4fd51fa11df619eda8ad006cb5a5_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>暗蓝小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c1789bb9b0dce70d65f7622630cc64c2_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>暗蓝小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-f918128dd134614bb3b9f640e9bda227_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>暗蓝小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-351a6b0083dc8065409e7356e93272f7_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>暗蓝小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-935e22bc3fe2b84193b548f9d07e8d8e_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>暗蓝小菇，有多小这就很明显了</figcaption></figure>
<p>同样是蓝色的<strong>靛藍小菇（ <em>Mycena indigotica</em>）</strong></p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e4f16d72177800fe63c2bbff8f951e09_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>靛藍小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-abdf482ee663eaa1e4f1dd1c6b2f6bb3_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>靛藍小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e0f3f52ab948db62aaaabb436e7f81c8_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>靛藍小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-dd70ce10a485fee0acdb803f433a6a8a_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>靛藍小菇</figcaption></figure>
<p>同样是蓝色的<strong>近蓝盖小菇 （<em>Mycena subcyanocephala</em>）</strong></p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-be96994f3d18bfd61163018cd0217552_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>近蓝盖小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-80aeed290646abb240ba752d7038e4ef_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>近蓝盖小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-7232635fc6d0c83717fd533eb84f9755_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>近蓝盖小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2f121bf59532805e6af63c296517a6e1_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>近蓝盖小菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2d4fe95296622ba42b71b9cdad291491_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>近蓝盖小菇，可见其有多小</figcaption></figure>
<p>此外，还有<strong>炫蓝蘑菇（<em>Mycena interrupta</em>）</strong></p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1f1bd8c580960ea013938081442a6b6e_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>炫蓝蘑菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-9314610e31d7f2734cc3d2592d7b58d4_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>炫蓝蘑菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-200592065d4e80078f6d545d49131387_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>炫蓝蘑菇</figcaption></figure>
<p>这也是一种特别小的蘑菇，菌盖直径通常在 0.6 至 2 厘米之间，菌柄高度也只有 1 至 2 厘米左右。刚刚长出来的子实体呈现晶莹的蓝色，慢慢的从菌盖边缘开始褪色，成熟后颜色会从边缘开始逐渐褪淡，变成蓝白色或灰白色。</p>
<p>炫蓝蘑菇是一种腐生真菌，喜欢生长在在雨林、桉树林等潮湿环境中的腐木上，主要分布在澳大利亚、新西兰和智利等地。在中国湖南炎陵地区也曾有过罕见记录的报道。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-7b0a0a7b22c73e89eabaa76c012bd1bb_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>炫蓝蘑菇</figcaption></figure>
<p>最后再例举几种蓝色的小菇。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4f654b51cb0bc36b410e03bbd20ac033_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>冷足小菇（Mycena amicta）</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ff34da8eb95fbf7435a6661f6d7348f7_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>冷足小菇（Mycena amicta）</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-485a6e74354bedd398bdcd5b7e5fa0d1_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Mycena cyanocephala</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-c5d22aba567b679d57f74bf6d3ca3468_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Mycena cyanocephala</figcaption></figure>
<p>小菇属的真菌子实体通常都很小，一般认为它们的毒性也不是很强。不过这玩意儿实在是太小了，也吃不到个啥。就别纠结“能怎好”了。</p>
<hr>
<p>说到蓝色的蘑菇，<strong>粉褶菌科（Entolomataceae）</strong>有话要说，，这个科里奇特的美丽蘑菇也不少，比如靛蓝色的尖尖巫婆帽小蘑菇——<strong>霍氏粉褶菌（<em>Entoloma hochstetter</em>）</strong>。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3a867570395be95b6bb9b10155e01ca7_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>霍氏粉褶菌</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-c5f82d46e29c679ece1c2b7552b1d369_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>霍氏粉褶菌</figcaption></figure>
<p>这种蓝色蘑菇隶属于粉褶菌科，主要在亚洲及大洋洲出现，尤其在新西兰最为常见和著名，以阔叶林和针叶林为其生境。它的子实体不算大，<span class="nolink">菌盖</span>直径 4 厘米左右。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-08cc64aa1a464cf5e66bfe1d27db116c_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>霍氏粉褶菌</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5145fa8572da5cfc5c8ab42ffe9f7118_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>霍氏粉褶菌</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-075be007fa89ee3b63d9d68bf9c88ed7_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>霍氏粉褶菌</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d68c9552467219bdbc24a0e2417e99bf_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>霍氏粉褶菌</figcaption></figure>
<p>遗憾的是，由于其毒性还没人正经研究过，所以能不能吃这件事情的答案是——不知道。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-bd8831fc9b0c307e1a843b9a5e2f4dec_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>新西兰曾将这种小蘑菇印上了钞票</figcaption></figure>
<p>除了霍氏粉褶菌，粉褶菌科还有不少蓝色的小蘑菇，比如：</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ab01a6d75aa1bb2ba656e8b3d9cc7ea4_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Entoloma subcarneum</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-78a9050c2b24d28881a195f7cb6b39c6_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Entoloma burkilliae</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ad80efa46f90a5a8b25ba75aa9af116a_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Entoloma percoelestinum</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cdcd88378457b8c018b9131de87856ac_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Entoloma indigoferum</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b7c0e2a8bc4c6f390e13a814c87b361d_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Entoloma indigoferum</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7d731e79d09c27522c26376c55455538_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>光亮粉褶菌（Entoloma nitidum）</figcaption></figure>
<hr>
<p><strong>笼头菌科（<em>Clathraceae</em>）</strong>，也是一个造型奇特的类群。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8490f42b61bdc9367bb780c3efb6ed83_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>红笼头菌（Clathrus ruber）</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-94393557e1b42a2cc57e848b9b9f6f1e_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>红笼头菌（Clathrus ruber）</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8f01d32c4fe02fa63a111327d406537b_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>红笼头菌幼子实体</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e8b97067015a1437f93de70e4e004f20_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>红笼头菌幼子实体，菌蛋外皮刚刚破开</figcaption></figure>
<p>红笼头菌隶属于鬼笔科，和同科的亲戚一样，它的幼年子实体是<strong>一个卵圆形或球形的白色“菌蛋”</strong>，部分或完全埋于土中或腐殖质中。成熟时，菌蛋的外皮破裂，菌柄迅速伸长，将顶部的结构托出地面，它的顶部的造型十分奇特，呈<strong>网格状、臂状或笼状</strong>。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-552ec1c4ec52730fa8062f58e9ffcfa4_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Clathrus natalensis 幼子实体</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-aa97619a8e3853cbf0e1f0ec9b131066_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Clathrus natalensis</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c463f61995fd34010135fe8ee82f64c8_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Clathrus baumii</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f46a3d0ca05e94b59d8a5163fc330e7f_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Clathrus baumii</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-affb04ef735a1194d10d47fc3a01d362_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>阿切氏笼头菌（Clathrus archeri）幼子实体</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-94e9b19e69aa6f3c399aae07ca124abb_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>阿切氏笼头菌（Clathrus archeri）</figcaption></figure>
<p>笼头菌的的子实体会产生硫化氢、甲硫醇等物质，</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-a2bf489279e785632acc865c687ed7c1_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>阿切氏笼头菌（Clathrus archeri）</figcaption></figure>
<p>散发出强烈的腐肉或粪便气味。事实上，它是靠吸引<strong>苍蝇、粪金龟</strong>等喜食腐肉的昆虫帮它传播孢子，昆虫落在孢体上舔食时，它们的脚和身体会沾满担孢子，并随着昆虫飞行散播到各处。</p>
<p>至于“能怎好”，这东西这么臭，就别纠结吃的事儿了。</p>
<hr>
<p><strong>珊瑚菌科（ Clavariaceae）</strong>，和上面几种真菌一样，它们的子实体同样没有传统蘑菇的菌盖和菌褶，其中很多种类的子实体从主枝上分出的多级分枝，形成簇生的、灌木状，像树状珊瑚一样的外形。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5183ceb63726e822753ba0df508ac1c4_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Clavaria schaefferi</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c8e948c1b773d016826766c6a31dcd3e_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Clavaria schaefferi</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-53754db33190b87aa8e9ae0c9d2ad37b_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Clavaria schaefferi</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0ca2ecc1e5fe0e495a1075fa1672931c_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Clavaria schaefferi</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-5c9b5ea52e515bb5ec3fc5f450616c9a_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Ramariopsis pulchella</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-91b7874f4a9e8b58f03fedbb676bc0b6_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Ramariopsis pulchella</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-011bfe871dddf64aaa62c606107f90d5_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Ramariopsis pulchella</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-aef689deb4861eec93c907c9a17a5012_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>堇紫珊瑚菌（Clavaria zollingeri）</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4dbde0955f8dfcccae289046f6909913_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>堇紫珊瑚菌（Clavaria zollingeri）</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7da9329ec57d344b1d222657d22eec71_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Ramariopsis crocea</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bb5d488db272035f37b63fb3a8fcb989_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Ramariopsis crocea</figcaption></figure>
<p>关于“能怎好”，珊瑚菌大部分种类<strong>并没什么特殊风味</strong>，且产量小，不值得采集，且部分种类有毒，切勿随意采摘食用。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-78be54eb39a981a79dc429d3d6024cbc_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>孔策拟枝瑚菌（Ramariopsis kunzei）</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-89d682a5deecd32ed85229f64e4ff3ba_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Ramariopsis ramarioides</figcaption></figure>
<hr>
<p>再来一个粉粉嫩嫩的小蘑菇。</p>
<p>泡头菌科的<strong>玫耳属（<em>Rhodotus</em>）</strong>是一个单种属，<strong>仅包含一个公认的物种</strong>：<strong>Rhodotus palmatus</strong>。它外观独特，菌盖呈独特的<strong>粉红色、鲑鱼肉色或桃橙色</strong>，表面覆盖着显著的、类似血管或网状的皱纹。正因如此，它也被称为<strong>皱皮胶菇</strong>、<strong>桃胶菇</strong>或<strong>网纹玫耳</strong>。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1704bad7ab8b6ba2c31aceb727ae2998_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Rhodotus palmatus</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-58e46dec147c18a40751f780ab5d7902_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Rhodotus palmatus</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-10b83cdcc07ba199f7dce300d7e5e335_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Rhodotus palmatus</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-9afe6174d7912b44981fe57c75393e35_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Rhodotus palmatus</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-22f7b8c8011473c75a194aef06f3c0f3_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Rhodotus palmatus</figcaption></figure>
<p>玫耳是<strong>腐生菌</strong>，生长在已经高度腐烂的硬木，比如榆木和山毛榉等，它通常出现在倒木或枯死的树桩上。虽然广泛分布于北半球的温带地区，包括欧洲、北美和亚洲，包括我国。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3323d7d2a541492e4c5fd38a3df60558_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Rhodotus palmatus</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-43def80eabc6b114173f57ab6ee35839_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>Rhodotus palmatus</figcaption></figure>
<p>由于相对少见，几乎没有形成大规模的、传统的食用历史。<strong>既没有可靠的民间记录表明它是一种安全的食用菌，也没有系统的科学文献或病例报告明确指出其毒性成分和中毒症状。</strong>未知的风险往往也是巨大的风险，因此，同样不建议采食。</p>
<hr>
<p>最后以一种紫色的蘑菇结束本篇回答。<span class="nolink">丝膜菌科</span>有一种外形类似《植物大战僵尸》中大喷菇的紫色蘑菇——阿切氏丝膜菌（<em>Cortinarius archeri</em>）</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a0e9f28365ebb58149429be61e9b40c8_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>《植物大战僵尸》中大喷菇的紫色蘑菇</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4f462f97089b7a2e2d5121ea1e79e7de_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>阿切氏丝膜菌</figcaption></figure>
<p>阿切氏丝膜菌的菌盖直径可达 8-10 厘米，菌柄长度约为 6-12 厘米，在同类中算是比较大型的蘑菇。</p>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-b5799a840c64ec9961da75a1d07928c6_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>阿切氏丝膜菌</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-221890b8042111cc69e835bf077249fc_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>阿切氏丝膜菌</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7c6b061fe4e61c4876087dec20ba32ff_720w.jpg?source=8673f162" alt=""><figcaption>阿切氏丝膜菌</figcaption></figure>
<p>这种蘑菇主要分布在澳大利亚南部的桉树林中，虽然对于阿切氏丝膜菌的毒性研究尚不清楚，不过丝膜菌属里包含了剧毒物种，因此在“能怎好”方面，同样是不建议食用。</p>
</div>
</div>


<div class="view-more"><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/2067927081439031323">查看知乎讨论<span class="js-question-holder"></span></a></div>

</div>


</div>
