<div class="question">
<h2 class="question-title">瞎扯 · 你见过最反人类的设计是什么？</h2>

<div class="answer">

<div class="meta">
<img class="avatar" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-fc734cfcc0b308e24640f9b5a2d2316d_l.jpg?source=8673f162">
<span class="author">知乎日报</span>
<a href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/None/answer/None" class="originUrl" hidden>查看知乎原文</a>
</div>

<div class="content">
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/57773589/answer/2051749320156886135">​你见过最反人类的设计是什么？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/0c2a0204606b75a5874d8c95e4ae7d8c" target="_blank">@WhatTheDuck</a></div>
 ：糖三角，几十年了都没想明白怎么吃才不会让糖撒出来</blockquote>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/408393423/answer/2053858749626966406">掉 san 究竟是一种怎样的体验？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/b535ab09b3de1b692b874e940b7601f4" target="_blank">@这次一定</a></div>
 ：猪眼睛砂锅饭<br>还越加越多<br>真顶不住</blockquote>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-79f798585bee7e6fe8de7aab181a86ae_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/566420596/answer/2050976306272134029">最令你醍醐灌顶的一句话是什么？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/7657daddf4914fd19f9af7da7a409ba4" target="_blank">@冰箱菌</a></div>
 ：今天刚看到的：<br>好想把这张图设置成头像，又怕被领导打死。算了算了。</blockquote>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0f61c32b01a1c8557ed03a429e5ca949_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/1990924772977160783/answer/2046014367116924317">为什么有些猫咪不喜欢被抱？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/6a58b3002b2cfa116fc44d434c68f7ca" target="_blank">@一苇奈何</a></div>
 ：看人。。<br>我家猫只允许我抱 15 秒，时间卡的很准，一超时，马上开始挣扎。。除非你抱它去看鱼。。<br>只有抱着它看鱼的时候，它才老实。。<br>眼神清澈， 专注。。还伸着脖子。。<br>同时全身蠕动，对你发出信号：可以抱的再靠前些，孤要伸爪子抓鱼了。。</blockquote>
<p class="ztext-empty-paragraph"> <br><br>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/389982844/answer/1983501764868187079">为什么说《名侦探柯南》崩了？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/d94be61bc9bb92582db820e86e3577fa" target="_blank">@冯虚御风</a></div>
 ：水的太久了，久的让人已经忘记了，<a class="RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1" href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=281549064&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E9%BB%91%E8%A1%A3%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87&amp;zhida_source=entity" target="_blank">黑衣组织</a>把人变小到底是为什么？</blockquote>
<hr>
<p>✨恭喜你发现了（即将成为）知乎最好笑的地方，加入「扯点好笑的」圈子，每天看点段子梗图神回复，一起一本正经地胡说八道吧！</p>
